// A line comment runs from the slashes to the end of the line.

/* A block comment runs from the opening marker to the closing one, and
   can span as many lines as it likes. Block comments do not nest: the
   first closing marker ends the comment however many openers precede it. */

use IO.Std.write_line

write_line("ghul has two kinds of comment" /* and either can sit mid-line */)

